.TH "SOPLOS-WELCOME" "1" "2026-10-19" "Soplos Linux" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
soplos-welcome \- Advanced welcome and system setup application for Soplos Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B soplos-welcome
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B soplos-welcome
is the primary welcome and system configuration application for Soplos Linux installations.
Built with modern Tauri 2, Rust, and Svelte architecture, it provides an intuitive,
beautiful, and secure interface for initial system personalization, hardware configuration,
driver installation, kernel management, and software discovery:
.IP \[bu] 2
Complete hardware detection and driver management (NVIDIA, AMD, Wi-Fi, VM Tools).
.IP \[bu]
Recommended software management across APT, Flatpak, and AppImages.
.IP \[bu]
Kernel management and optimization (Liquorix, XanMod, Soplos Kernels).
.IP \[bu]
System security, backup tools, and firewall management.
.IP \[bu]
Desktop customization and font rendering tuning for XFCE, GNOME, and KDE Plasma.
.IP \[bu]
Gaming center with performance profiles, sysctl tuning, and game launchers.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show summary of options.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/xdg/autostart/org.soplos.welcome.desktop
User autostart entry for automatic launch on session login.
.TP
.I /usr/share/polkit-1/actions/org.soplos.welcome.policy
Polkit policy defining administrator privileges for driver and system operations.
.TP
.I ~/.config/soplos-welcome/
User configuration directory.
